{"id":"71cba92f19dac4d2","group":"92","path":"92/92-ax-g-axioms.md","title":"Axioms of System G","display":"ax-g-axioms — Axioms of System G","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ax-g-axioms","aliases":["92-ax-g-axioms"],"display":"ax-g-axioms — Axioms of System G","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","[[92-ax-peano-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 28–30；第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 45–47、57）","source_status":"本地 Hilbert 呈现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ax-g-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ax-g-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-g-axioms — Axioms of System G"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89c266445c099752\" href=\"?note=89c266445c099752\" title=\"92-ax-peano-arithmetic\">92-ax-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 28–30；第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 45–47、57）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地 Hilbert 呈现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\)</span> (logical axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"89c266445c099752\" href=\"?note=89c266445c099752\" title=\"92-ax-peano-arithmetic\">92-ax-peano-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}\\)</span> (formal-system axiom projection, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_G\\)</span> (definition-target abbreviation for the axiom set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}g\\text{-}axioms} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_G\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)=\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\mathrm{PA}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}g\\text{-}axioms} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_G\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)=\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\mathrm{PA}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_G\\)</span> : 系统G的公理集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{logic}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{logic}}\\)</span> : 逻辑公理（命题和谓词逻辑）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Peano}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Peano}}\\)</span> : 算术公理（Peano算术变体）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>表示递归函数的结论依赖具体表示定理以及<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>包含的算术强度；它不是上述公理集恒等式本身的直接定义后果</li>\n<li>这是不完备性定理的技术前提</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>此处公理是本地 G 的呈现。原书逻辑模式采用 Kalish–Montague 的一次原子出现替换 L7，L5/L6 侧条件是不出现该变量；不能把本库一般无捕获代入公理直接称为原书同一模式。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 III 章 pp. 28–30；第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 45–47、57）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"89c266445c099752","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_G$ (logical axiom set, see [[92-df-logical-axiom]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"89c266445c099752","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}$ (Peano axiom set, see [[92-ax-peano-arithmetic]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ax}$ (formal-system axiom projection, see [[92-df-axiom-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogAx}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}g\\text{-}axioms} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_G\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)=\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\mathrm{PA}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{logic}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Peano}}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1644,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-ax-g-axioms]]"}],"outgoing":["e0eabee5d77258a7","e948c25f4a467fa1","89c266445c099752","35c764f4e9f21f28"]}